{"kind":"stack","id":"light-reflection","title":"Light and reflection: noticing light bounce off surfaces","theme":{"background":"#fdf6e3","foreground":"#1f2933","font":"Arial, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-term","content":"Reflection"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-def","content":"Reflection is when light bounces back off a surface. We can see things because light reflects off them into our eyes."},{"type":"button","id":"c1-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-term","content":"Shiny surface"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-def","content":"A smooth, shiny surface, like a mirror or still water, reflects light clearly. A rough surface scatters the light in many directions."},{"type":"button","id":"c2-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"What happens to light when it hits a mirror?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"It bounces back","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"It soaks into the glass","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"It turns into sound","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"Which surface reflects light best?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"A rough brick wall","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"A piece of black cloth","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"A smooth, polished metal spoon","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"mirror"},{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"Why can you see your face in a mirror?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"Light from your face reflects off the mirror into your eyes","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"The mirror makes its own light","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-c","label":"Your face glows in the dark","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-s","content":"Sam is outside on a sunny day. A beam of sunlight hits a puddle. Which way will Sam go to see the sun's reflection?"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-a","label":"Stand where the reflected light lands, so you can see the bright spot","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Look at the puddle from the side, away from the light","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-s","content":"Sam stands in the right place and sees a bright spot of sunlight dancing on the wall. Well done, Sam!"},{"type":"button","id":"c7-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-s","content":"Sam looks from the side and sees only dull water. The reflection is hard to see from there. Try standing where the light bounces to you."},{"type":"button","id":"c8-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"Which picture shows light reflecting?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"A torch shining on a mirror and making a bright spot","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"end"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"A candle burning in a dark room with no mirror","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"end"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"A closed box with nothing inside","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"end"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"end","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"end-h","content":"You finished the reflection quiz!"},{"type":"text","id":"end-m","content":"Great work noticing how light bounces off surfaces. Keep looking for shiny things around you."}],"actions":[]}}
